       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECTC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEXT         PIC X(30) VALUE "COBOL CODE COOL".
       01  WS-COUNT-O      PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT-O FOR ALL "O"
           DISPLAY "12 - INSPECT TALLYING"
           DISPLAY "TEXT: " WS-TEXT
           DISPLAY "COUNT OF O: " WS-COUNT-O
           STOP RUN.